,"closed_at":null},"comments":0,"created_at":"2026-08-12T23:16:02Z","updated_at":"2026-08-24T23:13:13Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"MEMBER","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/122355","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122355","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122355.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122355.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"- **Depends on https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122058.**\r\n- Follow-up to https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122066 (can be merged independently).\r\n\r\nThis aims to improve the particle system's usability by setting sensible defaults automatically. This should greatly reduce the number of clicks required to achieve a fully functional particle setup (with scale, color and flipbook animation support).\r\n    \r\nFor compatibility reasons, Particles created via code or in older versions of Godot are not affected.\r\n\r\nCompared to the proposal, this makes a few changes to the default setup:\r\n\r\n- Enable random initial particle angle to reduce visible repetition.\r\n- Use a square texture shape, so that particle rotation can be discerned.\r\n- Reduce texture size to 12×12, so that the size in 2D (which depends on texture size) is mostly consistent with the size in 3D.\r\n\r\n___\r\n\r\n- This closes https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/15317.\r\n\r\n**Testing project:** [test_particles_created_in_editor.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/31007372/test_particles_created_in_editor.zip)\r\n\r\n## Preview\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/596087e5-5203-45be-8764-a202b24b6aac\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/865ac5b6-9c5e-47f8-8875-aad02a0fafb3\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/3904c13d-0a7b-4541-876f-cef45c54b27f","closed_by":null,"r